<title>UK: SBNSW sets A$100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>SBNSW sets A$100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATE BANK OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    17.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.95    PAY DATE    17.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
